+{"schemaVersion":"1","kind":"finding","id":"fnd_01M2G2AGNMHKF9PCB4C85A3JQ3","companyId":"example-co","title":"MongoDB MCP tool schemas carry no personal-data classification markers","description":"src/tools/mongodb/mongodbSchemas.ts:1-107 (and, by extension, every mongodb/* tool argsShape it feeds) defines filter, projection, document and pipeline fields as opaque EJSON or `.passthrough()` records with only a `.describe()` prose hint (e.g. `zAutoEmbedVectorSearchStageParams`, `VectorSearchStage`). No field, in this file or anywhere under src/tools/mongodb, carries a data-classification annotation (x-data-classification, x-dpdp-category, @pii or equivalent), although applications/mcp-gateway/README.md and applications/mcp-gateway/env/{qa,prod}.json declare the connected client-data and order stores pii + financial. Commit aaa72a040db4c32f3d6488d5e28e2892a68e9ee0. zEJSON is defined as z.object({}).loose() in src/tools/args.ts:88-90; .passthrough() appears only in find.ts:22 and create/createIndex.ts:164, not in mongodbSchemas.ts itself.","severity":"medium","confidence":"confirmed","controlIds":["sebi-cscrf-2024:ID.AM.S5","dpdp-rules-2025:6(1)"],"regulatoryRefs":[{"regulator":"SEBI","instrument":"sebi-cscrf-2024","controlId":"ID.AM.S5"},{"regulator":"MeitY","instrument":"dpdp-rules-2025","controlId":"6(1)"},{"regulator":"ISO","instrument":"iso-27001-2022","controlId":"A.5.12"}],"target":{"type":"repo","appId":"mcp-gateway","repoId":"mongodb-mcp-server"},"location":{"path":"src/tools/mongodb/mongodbSchemas.ts","startLine":1,"endLine":107},"fingerprint":"014e4817400eb27b724472fb10d87ee03186aeab06604ddda8581bfbd41b4b42","source":{"kind":"sarif","ruleId":"SCH-PII-01","tool":"maxwell-schema-auditor","toolVersion":"1.0.0"},"status":"open","firstSeenAt":"2026-09-14T13:14:50Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-14T13:14:50Z","slaDueAt":"2026-09-28T13:14:50Z","slaBasis":{"instrument":"sebi-cscrf-2024","controlId":"PR.MA.S3","topic":"patch-sla","severity":"medium","days":14},"relatedObserv