+{"schemaVersion":"1","kind":"finding","id":"fnd_01M2G2AGVRZPBP3VH8FNAYH46V","companyId":"example-co","title":"MCP HTTP transport has no default authentication requirement","description":"src/transports/mcpHttpServer.ts:306-319: setupMiddlewares() is the only request gate on the HTTP transport; it loops over `Object.entries(this.userConfig.httpHeaders)` and rejects a request only if a configured header value mismatches. `httpHeaders` defaults to `{}` (src/common/config/userConfig.ts:136-143), so with no operator configuration the loop performs zero comparisons and `next()` is always called: every JSON-RPC tool call is reachable unauthenticated over HTTP once the transport binds beyond loopback (httpHost defaults to 127.0.0.1; the repo's AWS Dockerfile sets host 0.0.0.0 and the Azure bicep binds to '::'). Consistent with this, deploy/azure/bicep/params_template.json ships `authMode: NOAUTH` by default; a proper Azure-AD OIDC auth config exists only as an opt-in second template. env/prod.json lists this app's prod environment as exposure: partner with dataClassification [pii, financial]. Commit aaa72a040db4c32f3d6488d5e28e2892a68e9ee0.","severity":"high","confidence":"confirmed","controlIds":["sebi-cscrf-2024:PR.AA.S6","dpdp-rules-2025:6(1)(b)"],"regulatoryRefs":[{"regulator":"SEBI","instrument":"sebi-cscrf-2024","controlId":"PR.AA.S6"},{"regulator":"MeitY","instrument":"dpdp-rules-2025","controlId":"6(1)(b)"},{"regulator":"NIST","instrument":"nist-csf-2.0","controlId":"PR.AA-03"},{"regulator":"ISO","instrument":"iso-27001-2022","controlId":"A.8.5"},{"regulator":"OWASP","instrument":"owasp-asvs-5.0","controlId":"V6"}],"target":{"type":"repo","appId":"mcp-gateway","repoId":"mongodb-mcp-server"},"location":{"path":"src/transports/mcpHttpServer.ts","startLine":306,"endLine":319},"fingerprint":"2b47a8fb3b6e3225e8b94541ffb4b7c068f7cb9440d9d22aa3c053fe690a20a6","source":{"kind":"sarif","ruleId":"SCH-API-01","tool":"maxwell-schema-auditor","toolVersion":"1.0.0"},"status":"open","firstSeenAt":"2026-09-14T13:14:50Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-14T13:14:50Z","slaDueAt":"2026-09-21T13:14:50Z","slaBasis":{"instrument":"sebi-cscrf-2024","controlId":"PR.MA.S3","topic":"patch-sla","severity":"high","days":7},"relatedObservationIds":["obs_01M2G2AGHZT55J4AESPB6B0FPH","obs_01M2G2AGK6ZVDTF4D9A0FNYF6V"],"evidence":[{"type":"sarif","ref":"kpis/data/raw/sessions/314aa113-98aa-471e-941d-e1aa88798b5a/probe-schemas.mcp-gateway.mongodb-mcp-server.sarif.export.json","sha256":"083528627e5887bdeea0827ad8655e5a65240c94c36785ff58a893c3b00b3170","description":"SCH-API-01 fail result"}],"tags":["schema","data-protection","static-probe","authentication","mcp"],"provenance":{"harness":"claude-code","generatedAt":"2026-09-14T13:14:50Z","sessionId":"314aa113-98aa-471e-941d-e1aa88798b5a","runId":"run_01M2FGNVVQ15ZKXZWGW74YWAAQ","workflow":"probe-schemas","agent":"soc-ledger-keeper"},"recordedAt":"2026-09-14T13:14:50Z"}
+{"schemaVersion":"1","kind":"finding","id":"fnd_01M2G2AGX1GZ9THG6HJ1VPP1EP","companyId":"example-co","title":"Core MongoDB tool arguments accept unbounded, unvalidated input that reaches the driver","description":"src/tools/args.ts:78-90: `zEJSON()` (`z.object({}).loose().transform(toEJSON)`) accepts any key/value pair with no maxItems on enclosing arrays (AggregateArgs.pipeline, defined at src/tools/mongodb/read/aggregate.ts:47-49) and no maxLength/pattern on keys or values, and is used as the schema for find/export `filter` and for every aggregation stage that is not `$vectorSearch`. src/tools/mongodb/mongodbTool.ts:11-17 defines `DBOperationArgs.database` and `CollOperationArgs.collection` as plain `z.string()` with no length cap or character allow-list, unlike `CommonArgs.string()` (args.ts:22-23), which applies `NO_UNICODE_REGEX` and is used for the Atlas tool arguments in the same repo. mcpHttpServer.ts:307 enforces express.json({limit: httpBodyLimit}) (default 100 KiB) and result-side caps (maxDocumentsPerQuery, maxBytesPerQuery) exist, but neither validates individual field length/shape, so per-field input validation is still missing. Commit aaa72a040db4c32f3d6488d5e28e2892a68e9ee0.","severity":"high","confidence":"confirmed","controlIds":["sebi-cscrf-2024:PR.AA.S17","dpdp-rules-2025:6(1)(g)"],"regulatoryRefs":[{"regulator":"SEBI","instrument":"sebi-cscrf-2024","controlId":"PR.AA.S17"},{"regulator":"MeitY","instrument":"dpdp-rules-2025","controlId":"6(1)(g)"},{"regulator":"OWASP","instrument":"owasp-asvs-5.0","controlId":"V4"}],"target":{"type":"repo","appId":"mcp-gateway","repoId":"mongodb-mcp-server"},"location":{"path":"src/tools/args.ts","startLine":78,"endLine":90},"fingerprint":"972eb67e82a0bd45304b76ee039ea11300642088dc044b5848de7c8df60a2840","source":{"kind":"sarif","ruleId":"SCH-API-02","tool":"maxwell-schema-auditor","toolVersion":"1.0.0"},"status":"open","firstSeenAt":"2026-09-14T13:14:50Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-14T13:14:50Z","slaDueAt":"2026-09-